# The build context of packaging/Dockerfile is the source tree only: no
# repository metadata, build trees, archives, or local notes, so that they
# neither enlarge the context nor invalidate the layer of MDIR's sources.
.git
.github
.claude
.codex
build
build-*
**/__pycache__
*.zip
*.tar.gz
*.sif
docs/diagrams
docs/paper/out
notes
AGENTS.md
LEADER.md
